---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="ISHARA">
<h1>Workflow</h1>
<h2>Webcam → Hand tracking (MediaPipe) → Gesture recognition
      → Lock & hold validation → Keyboard command (PyAutoGUI)
      → Active slideshow window</h2>
      <p><strong>Capture:</strong> OpenCV reads frames from the webcam.<br>
        <strong>Detect:</strong> MediaPipe locates the hand and its landmarks.
        <br><strong>Classify:</strong> the app determines which gesture the hand is making.
        <br><strong>Validate:</strong> the gesture must be held long enough, and the system must be unlocked.
        <br><strong>Act:</strong> PyAutoGUI sends the corresponding keystroke to the focused window.<br>
        Because the final step is a plain keystroke, no integration with the slideshow application is needed.</p>
</Layout>

<style>
  h1 {
    font-size: 34px;
    font-weight: 500;
    letter-spacing: -0.03em;
    margin-bottom: 8px;
  }

  .subtitle {
    color: var(--text-muted);
    margin-bottom: 40px;
  }

  .post-list {
    list-style: none;
  }

  .post-list li {
    padding: 24px 0;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
  }

  .post-list a {
    display: flex;
    align-items: baseline;
    justify-content: space-between;
    text-decoration: none;
  }

  .post-title {
    color: var(--text);
    font-size: 18px;
    font-weight: 500;
  }

  .post-title:hover {
    color: var(--link);
  }

  .post-date {
    color: var(--text-muted);
    font-size: 13px;
    flex-shrink: 0;
    margin-left: 16px;
  }

  .post-excerpt {
    color: var(--text-muted);
    font-size: 15px;
    margin-top: 8px;
  }

  .empty {
    color: var(--text-muted);
    font-size: 14px;
    margin-top: 32px;
  }
</style>